  "notes": "Boot a Creature from the Black Lagoon ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released), the three trough switches 56-58 closed, the inverted top-left rollover 15 at its open level 1, and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled; the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM loop with Escape, close the coin door, insert four coins and press Start. When the ROM pulses the trough release (4), move a ball into the shooter lane (66) and plunge it, then close the left subway switch (16), deliver the ball to the lower right popper (37) and wait for its kick (3), close the center subway switch (17), deliver the ball again, and close 16 a second time. The lamps and DMD frames show which feature the ROM awards for each switch: the K-I-S-S lamps 21-24 and the Snack Bar targets.",
